guide butler-routes-completionist/undercity-city
title Undercity
levels 1-60
zone Undercity
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Cities
coords live
version 1

# Undercity is the Horde capital of the forsaken and a hub a player
# returns to across their whole leveling life, so this route groups by
# quarter and keeps every chain together. Out-of-city objectives ride in
# expedition legs grouped by destination, each with a deliberate zone-frame
# switch and a switch back. Every goto and complete below is a point from
# the game data; where the data gives no point the note says so instead of
# inventing one. Single-starter quests never double: 97022 stays Thunder
# Bluff's (Alodan's leg); multi-city class chains contract their own UC leg.

step Royal Quarter - the throne and its errands
  accept 5961 -- The Champion of the Banshee Queen - Lady Sylvanas Windrunner; Nathanos Blightcaller waits in the Plaguelands, very late
  note 5961 turns in to Nathanos on the Western Plaguelands leg below.
  accept 6145 -- The Crimson Courier - Varimathras; a Grand Crusader's Command from the Crimson Courier in the Plaguelands, very late
  note 6145's pre (6144, a Plaguelands accept) is out of contract - the complete and turn-in ride a dedicated mini-step below.

step Rogues' Quarter - Mennet's Deathstalkers
  accept 1886 only Rogue,Undead -- The Deathstalkers - Mennet Carkad; Astor Hadren's letter from Silverpine, early
  note 1886's letter rides the Silverpine leg below.
  accept 1998 only Rogue,Undead -- Fenwick Thatros - Mennet Carkad; Fenwick's head from Silverpine, early
  note 1998's objective rides the Silverpine leg below.
  accept 2378 only Rogue -- Find the Shattered Hand - Mennet Carkad; Shenthul waits in Orgrimmar, late
  note 2378 turns in to Shenthul on the Orgrimmar leg below.

step Magic Quarter - the warlock trainers
  accept 1472 only Warlock -- Devourer of Souls - Carendin Halgar; Godrick waits across the ring, early
  note 1472 is a talk leg (no objectives) - turn it in to Godrick now, then take 1476 and 65593.
  turnin 1472 only Warlock -- Devourer of Souls - the word to Godrick Farsan
  accept 1476 only Warlock -- Hearts of the Pure - Godrick Farsan; Dalin's and Comar's hearts, early
  note 1476's pre is the contracted 1472 above; its objectives ride the Silverpine and Arathi legs below.
  accept 65593 only Warlock -- Hearts of the Lovers - Godrick Farsan; Avelina's and Isaac's hearts, late
  note 65593's pre is the contracted 1472 above; its objectives ride the Silverpine and Barrens legs below.

step Upper Ring - Kaal' + chr(39) + 's warlocks
  accept 4489 only Warlock -- Summon Felsteed - Kaal Soulreaper; Strahad Farsan waits in the Barrens, mid
  note 4489 turns in to Strahad on the Barrens leg below; its follow-up (4490, Strahad' + chr(39) + 's chain) stays out.
  accept 4739 only Warlock -- In Search of Menara Voidrender - Kaal Soulreaper; Menara Voidrender waits in the Barrens, mid
  note 4739 turns in to Menara on the Barrens leg below; its follow-up (1796, Menara' + chr(39) + 's chain) stays out.
  accept 4969 only Warlock -- Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil - Kaal Soulreaper; Menara Voidrender waits in the Barrens, late
  note 4969 turns in to Menara on the Barrens leg below; its follow-up (1799, Menara' + chr(39) + 's chain) stays out.
step Magic Quarter - Anastasia's mages
  accept 1882 only Mage,Undead,Troll -- The Balnir Farmstead - Anastasia Hartwell; Balnir Snapdragons from Tirisfal, early
  note 1882's objective rides the Tirisfal leg below.
  accept 1943 only Mage,Orc,Undead,Troll -- Speak with Deino - Anastasia Hartwell; Deino waits in Durotar, late
  note 1943's follow-up (1944, Deino's chain) stays out - turn in to Deino on the Durotar leg and stop there.
  accept 1947 only Mage -- Journey to the Marsh - Anastasia Hartwell; Tabetha waits in Dustwallow, late
  note 1947 turns in to Tabetha on the Dustwallow leg below.
  accept 1953 only Mage -- Return to the Marsh - Anastasia Hartwell; Tabetha waits in Dustwallow, late
  note 1953's follow-up (1954, Tabetha's chain) stays out - turn in to Tabetha on the Dustwallow leg and stop there.
  accept 1960 only Mage,Orc,Undead,Troll -- Investigate the Alchemist Shop - Anastasia Hartwell; the shop counter, early
  note 1960 needs 1959 (Report to Anastasia, an Orgrimmar/Thunder Bluff accept) done in the world - if Anastasia will not offer it yet, work that chain and take the dedicated mini-step below on return; 1961 opens once 1960 turns in.

