  note 84396's objective rides the Burning Steppes leg below; the turn-in uses Oran's end.
  accept 84397 -- Northern Kalimdor - A Comprehensive Guide - Oran Snakewrithe; the book in Felwood, endgame
  note 84397's objective rides the Felwood leg below; the turn-in uses Oran's end.
  accept 84398 -- A Study of the Light - Oran Snakewrithe; the book in the Plaguelands, endgame
  note 84398's objective rides the Western Plaguelands leg below; the turn-in uses Oran's end.
  accept 84399 -- Ka-Boom! - Oran Snakewrithe; the book in Winterspring, endgame
  note 84399's objective rides the Winterspring leg below; the turn-in uses Oran's end.
  accept 84400 -- The Knight and the Lady - Oran Snakewrithe; the book in the Plaguelands, endgame
