  note 97286's pre is the forty-book chain above; every book turn-in rides the returns step below, then the capstone turns in here.
step Apothecarium - Faranell's poisons and the slime crew
  accept 1109 -- Going, Going, Guano! - Master Apothecary Faranell; Kraul Guano, mid
  note 1109's guano names no placed source in the data - check the bags for it.
  complete 1109 -- Kraul Guano from the bags for Faranell
  turnin 1109 -- Going, Going, Guano! - the guano to Faranell
  accept 1113 -- Hearts of Zeal - Master Apothecary Faranell; Hearts of Zeal from Tirisfal, mid
  note 1113's pre is the contracted 1109 above; its objective rides the Tirisfal leg below.
  accept 96988 -- Source of Power - Doctor Martin Felben; Cracked Sentry Cores, mid
  note 96988's cores name no placed source in the data - check the bags for them.
  complete 96988 -- six Cracked Sentry Cores from the bags for Felben
  turnin 96988 -- Source of Power - the cores to Felben
  accept 97049 -- Essence of Seeping Slimes - Chemist Fuely; Seeping Slime Essences, endgame
  note 97049's essences name no placed source in the data - check the bags for them.
  complete 97049 -- eight Seeping Slime Essences from the bags for Fuely
  turnin 97049 -- Essence of Seeping Slimes - the essences to Fuely
  accept 4293 -- A Sample of Slime... - Chemist Fuely; a Corrupted Felwood Sample, late
  complete 4293 @47.85,73.48 era -- five Corrupted Felwood Samples from Fuely's Testing Equipment for Fuely
  accept 4294 -- ... and a Batch of Ooze - Chemist Fuely; a Pure Un'Goro Sample, late
  complete 4294 @47.74,73.57 era -- five Pure Un'Goro Samples from Fuely's Testing Equipment for Fuely
  accept 4642 -- Melding of Influences - Chemist Fuely; a Merged Ooze Sample from Un'Goro, late
  note 4642's pre is the contracted 4293+4294 above; its objective rides the Un'Goro leg below.
  accept 95216 -- The New Plague - Theodore Griffs; a Highly Toxic Strain, early
  note 95216's pre (451, a Silverpine accept) is out of contract - the complete and turn-in ride a dedicated mini-step below.
  accept 97985 -- Thundering Hearts - Calder Gray; Stormheart's heart from Thousand Needles, mid
  note 97985's objective is an optional hunt on the Thousand Needles leg below - a missing Stormheart never wedges the route.
  accept 95204 -- Crest of Lordaeron - the Crest of Lordaeron, early
  note 95204 starts from the Crest of Lordaeron item, which names no placed source in the data - check the bags for it.
  turnin 95204 -- Crest of Lordaeron - the crest to Oran Snakewrithe

