  accept 357 -- The Lich's Identity - Bethor Iceshard; the Lich's Spellbook from Tirisfal, early
  note 357's pre (405, a Tirisfal accept) is out of contract; its objective rides the Tirisfal leg below.
  accept 446 -- Thule Ravenclaw - Bethor Iceshard; Renferrel waits in Silverpine, early
  note 446's pre (444, a Silverpine accept) is out of contract; its turn-in rides the Silverpine leg below, and its follow-up (448, a Silverpine accept) stays out.

