  note 8250's follow-up (8251, Sanath's chain) stays out - turn in to Sanath on the Azshara leg and stop there.
  accept 7562 only Warlock -- Mor'zul Bloodbringer - Martha Strain; Mor'zul waits in Searing Gorge, endgame
  note 7562 turns in to Mor'zul on the Searing Gorge leg below; its follow-up (7563, Mor'zul's chain) stays out.
  accept 8419 only Warlock -- An Imp's Request - Kaal Soulreaper; Felcloth and Impsy in Felwood, late
  note 8419's Felcloth is a generic world drop - check the bags for it.
