step Trade Quarter - Graham's engineering branches
  when skill Engineering 1

  note Graham's line needs the engineer's hands - skip it without the skill.
  accept 3526 optional -- Goblin Engineering - Graham Van Talen; Nixx Sprocketspring waits in Tanaris, late
  note 3526 turns in to Nixx back in this step; its follow-up (3638, Nixx's chain) stays out.
  accept 3635 optional -- Gnome Engineering - Graham Van Talen; Oglethorpe Obnoticus waits in Booty Bay, late
  note 3635 turns in to Oglethorpe back in this step; its follow-up (3642, Oglethorpe's chain) stays out.
  note Goblin and Gnome Engineering exclude each other - take one branch only; the other line stays unaccepted.
  turnin 3526 optional -- Goblin Engineering - Graham's word to Nixx Sprocketspring
  turnin 3635 optional -- Gnome Engineering - Graham's word to Oglethorpe Obnoticus
step Expedition - Tirisfal Glades, the clearing and the farmsteads
  zone map 1420

  tip Deathknell to the clearing to Balnir: Derrington, Bethor, Gunther, the Scarlet Preserve, Balnir, the Horror.
  turnin 5094 -- A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands! - Balthazad's word to High Executor Derrington
  complete 357 @67.96,42.09 era -- the Lich's Spellbook from Gunther's Books for Bethor
  turnin 357 -- The Lich's Identity - the spellbook to Bethor Iceshard
  note 366 opens once 357 turns in - Bethor stands in this clearing, Gunther below.
  accept 366 -- Return the Book - Bethor Iceshard; Gunther Arcanus waits below, early
  turnin 366 -- Return the Book - the book to Gunther Arcanus
  complete 1113 @81.36,33.72 era -- twenty Hearts of Zeal from the Scarlet Preservers for Faranell
  complete 1882 @77.39,61.76 era -- Balnir Snapdragons from the farmstead for Anastasia
  note The Whispering Horror at the clearing (8.89,60.21) drops the residue that starts 95328 - kill it here and take the accept if it dropped; the route never waits on it.
  accept 95328 -- Whispering Horror Residue - the Whispering Horror's residue from Tirisfal, early
  complete 79095 @59.4,52.3 era -- the Apothecary's Metaphysical Primer from the Society primer for Owen
  zone map 1458

